WEBVTT

00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:30.797
Patrick.

00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:35.615
Patrick was born in Liberia
to a family of 20 children.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.980
During the civil war,

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:41.923
he and his family were forced
to flee to Nigeria.

00:00:42.468 --> 00:00:45.206
There, in spite of his situation,

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.738
he graduated high school
with nearly perfect grades.

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:52.453
He wanted to continue to higher education,

00:00:52.477 --> 00:00:55.737
but due to his family
living on the poverty line,

00:00:55.761 --> 00:00:58.268
he was soon sent to South Africa

00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:02.005
to work and send back money
to feed his family.